- **IDs:** `gemini-3.6-flash`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 input tokens; 65,536 output tokens (Google AI developer docs).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, audio, and PDF input; text output (Google AI developer docs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Developer docs reference a pricing page for Gemini 3.6 Flash, but specific pricing values were not extracted in this pass; local metadata notes free tier/paid-tier pricing context.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Google/DeepMind model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

